{% if file_system %}Rows count down from the top and columns right from the left. Call end_round with the row and column of your square; your square cannot change after that. If the round ends before you call end_round, a square is chosen for you at random. A round ends once both of you have chosen, or after {{ round_seconds }} seconds.{% else %}Each figure starts every round on a square chosen at random, separately for you and your partner; the round's briefing says where both start. Rows count down from the top and columns right from the left. You have {{ moves_per_round }} moves per round: up, down, left and right each spend one. One move call can make up to {{ max_moves_per_call }} of them in a row, and your partner sees each one. A move off the grid is refused and spends nothing. Call end_round when you are on your final square, which then cannot change. If the round ends before you call end_round, the square you stand on counts. A round ends once both figures have finished, or after {{ round_seconds }} seconds.{% endif %}
